# Build outputs. The sheet, its JSON and the frame check image are committed so a reviewer can
# diff them without Playwright; everything else (backgrounds, GIFs, showcase, demos) is regenerated.
# build/review/ holds the per-creature review images a PR body links to (contact sheet, loop GIFs).
build/*
!build/spritesheet.png
!build/spritesheet.json
!build/check_hand_anims.png
!build/review/
